{"id":"bloss","lemma":"bloß","pos":"adv","rank":382,"glosses":["merely, only","Used to add emphasis or to respond to a request."],"ipa":"/bloːs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/De-blo%C3%9F.ogg/De-blo%C3%9F.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich wollte bloß einen Kaffee.","en":"I only wanted a cup of coffee.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},null,{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"coffee"}]},{"text":"Er ist bloß ein Kind.","en":"He is just a kid.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"kid"}]},{"text":"Ich möchte bloß gewinnen.","en":"I just want to win.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/389127","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},null,{"g":"to win"}]},{"text":"Ich habe bloß drei Bücher.","en":"I only have three books.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"three (numerical value…"},{"g":"book (collection of…","l":"Buch"}]},{"text":"Wie können wir das bloß machen?","en":"How can we possibly do that?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to make"}]}]}